WEBVTT

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:21.450
Ever since I was young, I loved to read.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:26.790
My favorite book was <i>The Adventures of Nike</i> .

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:31.990
It contained records of the witch, Nike,
as she traveled around the world.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.370
I want to go to lots of places like Nike!

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:48.950
Then first, you need to study
to become a witch like Nike.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.200
If I become a witch, then you'll let me travel?

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.370
Of course. Right?

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.580
Huh?

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.540
Yeah...

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:00.490
Only once you're older and become a witch, okay?

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:01.910
Really?

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.490
Really really?

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.240
Really really.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.370
I'm going to be a witch!

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:21.330
I don't mean to brag,

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.370
but I worked assiduously,

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:29.740
studying fervently, day after day.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.490
And then...

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.370
There was a girl who passed
the magic exams at age 14--

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:43.490
the youngest in the history of
the Peaceful Country of Robetta--

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.410
and she became an apprentice witch.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.120
That's right, it was me.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.490
Elaina, the Apprentice Witch

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.790
Congrats on passing your magic exams, Elaina.

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:03.790
We're so proud of you.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.490
What's wrong? You're not happy?

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:13.290
The other examinees were so weak...

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:18.200
At this rate, it's only a matter of time
before I become a full witch, huh?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.160
Oh?

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.870
Oh, my...

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.540
In order for an apprentice witch
to become a full witch,

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:29.580
she must study under another witch
and have her acknowledge her abilities.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.200
Coming!

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.200
Yes, what is it?

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:58.740
U-Um, I'm Elaina, and I just passed the magi--

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.330
Coming!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.040
Oh, you're...

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.700
I just passed the magic exams and--

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.580
However, it seemed the witches
of this country did not find it amusing

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:21.290
that I was the youngest to
ever pass the magic exams...

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.660
I can't do it! I'm sorry!

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:29.700
...and they all refused my
request to be their apprentice.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.200
At this rate, I won't be able to become a witch.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.700
What should I do...?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:44.540
It seems a suspicious witch has
settled down deep in the woods.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:51.080
I heard those rumors, too.
Apparently, she's called the Stardust Witch.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:57.790
I went to go meet this "Stardust Witch."

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.240
I thought that if she didn't know who I was,

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.990
then maybe she'd take me on as an apprentice.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.410
Is that it?

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.620
Now, now...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.540
The Stardust Witch...?

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:29.290
There, there!

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.240
Maybe I'll go home...

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:35.660
There!

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.410
Oh, good, good!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.290
Yup, yup!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.410
There, there!

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:47.120
Oh, oh, yay!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.240
Um, excuse me...

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.490
Oh? What's this?

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:55.950
Could you be Miss Elaina?

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.240
You know who I am?

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:02.330
Yes. You're the girl who passed
the magic exams easily at 14, right?

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.450
You're famous, for better or for worse.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.040
Well, did you need something?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.700
No. Sorry to bother you.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.660
Are you here to ask about
becoming my apprentice?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:18.790
In that case--

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.200
You're going to say no, anyway, right?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.870
It's fine.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.240
Huh?!

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.370
I've got time, anyway.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:31.290
But... um, me...?

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.330
I'm not the same as the Robetta witches.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:44.870
It doesn't matter what
kind of girl you are to me.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.990
Please let me be your apprentice!

00:05:54.740 --> 00:06:01.200
This is how I met the Stardust
Witch--my teacher, Miss Fran.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.910
Good morning!

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.330
Good morning...

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.540
I'm hungry. Please make something to eat.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.290
What would you like?

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:21.620
Let's see...

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.080
I feel like steak.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.450
Isn't that kind of heavy for breakfast?

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.700
Then, some of those weeds over there will do.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.120
Aren't you giving up a little too much?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.990
Then, bread will be fine!

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:44.580
I'm going to go pick some wild vegetables.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:50.540
Um, Miss Fran, I'd like you
to teach me some magic...

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:54.080
We'll do that later. I'm off!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.410
See you later...

00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:02.660
No matter how many days passed,
Miss Fran wouldn't teach me at all.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.990
Elaina, we're out of food.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.330
Please go buy some from the town.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:19.330
Elaina, please catch about five geckos.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.990
I need them for my research.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.740
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.620
Elaina, is dinner ready yet?

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.540
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:30.830
How to make painkillers...

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.990
Let's see...

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:45.370
Elaina, there's a spider in the bath.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:48.700
Please get rid of it. It's scary...

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.120
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.950
It's mixed in, huh...?

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.370
You don't like mushrooms?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:08.540
Witches should not be picky eaters.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.160
Elaina, please massage my shoulders.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.700
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.410
Oh, that feels good.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:35.700
Why won't you teach me any magic?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.870
Oh, harder!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:50.200
With this and that, a month passed
without her teaching me anything.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:55.740
I've just been doing chores
ever since coming here.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:59.080
What am I doing?

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.240
Do you finally feel like teaching me magic?

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:09.950
No, there's nothing for me to teach you.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.740
I see.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:14.450
Also, I don't feel like stew today.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:19.990
Please make something else.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.040
Very well.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.160
This seems to be a good time...

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.790
Elaina.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.580
Yes?

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:36.830
We'll have a test now.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.540
Huh?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:53.830
Miss Fran, what kind of test is this?

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.660
I'll have you fight against me.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.370
You're kidding... right?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.950
Okay, let's start.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.740
Huh?!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:47.330
If that's what you want,
then I'll send you flying!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:44.330
Is she trying to kill me?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.540
What's the matter?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.910
You overwhelmed everyone at the magic exams.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:55.830
Is that all you've got?

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.740
Let me have some more fun.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:36.120
Oh my, finished already?

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:42.200
Even though you're a star student,
you're nothing to write home about...

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.410
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:17.450
I didn't think you'd start crying...

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.790
Um... Let's see...

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.290
Take a look at this!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.290
Here are some of those butterflies you love!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.540
<i>I'm</i> not the one who likes butterflies!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.490
Th-Then...

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:43.200
Look, a crown made of weeds!

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.200
I don't need that!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.700
Then...

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.700
Look, how about this?

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:52.040
There, there--hot, hot! It's too hot!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.490
Um, in that case...

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.290
Calm down.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.080
Please, stop!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.910
What are you trying to do?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.950
I'm sorry, really.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.370
It looks like I overdid it a little.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.330
Please stop messing around!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.580
You were having fun teasing me!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.040
I wasn't having fun at all...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.950
You were never planning on making me a witch!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.240
I hate you!

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.990
I hate you all!

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:30.410
Even though I believed in you
and endured everything...

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.410
I believed that everything would work out...

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:38.160
But you're just the same
as those Robetta witches!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.330
I trusted you.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:44.290
You have no idea how hard I was working!

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:48.740
I just... wanted you to acknowledge me...

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.910
I really am sorry.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:02.790
I knew very well how you truly felt.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:05.330
You did a good job to endure it for so long.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.450
Are you trying to trick me again?

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:11.540
No, I won't trick you anymore.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.540
I'm at my limit, too.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:24.540
You know, I was doing all this
because your parents asked me to.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.990
What?

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:31.330
If she keeps going like this
and becomes an adult,

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.450
there might come a day
when she's unable to recover...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.870
That's why you want me
to take her as my apprentice

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:40.330
and teach her about failures and setbacks?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.540
Yes...

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.370
But...

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:49.660
Of course, we aren't asking you
to do this for free, Miss Fran.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:58.830
Oh, dear! I'm not a witch
who can be enticed by money...

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:04.620
I <i>grudgingly</i> accepted your parents' request.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.660
At first, I thought I'd put you
through extraordinary trials

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.540
so that you would learn about setbacks.

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:17.080
But you never balked at working hard
in order to achieve your goal,

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.040
you're talented,

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:24.410
and you understand very well how people see you.

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:27.450
I thought it wouldn't do
any good to give you trials

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:31.120
because you would just
endure them and rise again.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.580
But...

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:37.540
...that's also your main problem.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:42.290
You endure too much, Elaina.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:47.990
Please don't feel like all you
have to do is bear with everything.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.830
If there's something you don't like, fight it.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:54.950
Be able to clearly say "No" when you need to.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.700
So you can protect yourself.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:09.120
Then... the reason you wouldn't
teach me magic this whole time...

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.120
I was waiting for you to reach your limit.

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:15.290
It took a whole month!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:19.200
Today's test was for the same reason.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.990
I really am sorry.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.990
Don't endure.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:27.450
That was the first time I'd ever been told that.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.200
Miss Fran...

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:32.490
You have skill and talent.

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:36.910
All you're lacking is experience.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:40.700
My real training started on that day.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:44.080
In order to gain a lot
of different experiences...

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.200
Good morning, Miss Fran.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.950
Good morning, Elaina.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:55.120
I'm hungry, so please make something to eat.

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:57.700
Here are some weeds.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:01.240
Um, what kind of harassment is this?

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.240
You told me to stop enduring things,

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:09.200
so I tried to be honest about my feeling
like making food for you was a pain.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.790
Just kidding.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:16.490
Is yesterday's leftover stew
and some hard bread okay?

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.410
It is, right?

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.950
Yes.

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:24.910
In the days after that--

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.790
The days when I trained with Miss Fran--

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.990
Sometimes, they were hard...

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:42.370
...but they were very fulfilling and fun.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:12.990
You've become strong. Very strong.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:15.580
It's my first time beating you.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.660
With this, you're training's over.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:18.950
Huh?

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.660
You worked hard this past year.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:25.080
I don't have anything else to teach you.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.240
Congratulations, Elaina.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:40.080
The Stardust Witch officially
acknowledges you as a witch.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.080
Thank you very much.

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.700
By the way, about your witch title...

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.040
How about "the Ashen Witch"?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.580
How did you come up with it?

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.990
Your hair is the color of ash.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:55.950
Don't you think that's a little too simplistic?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.120
I thought it was pretty cool, though...

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:01.410
By the way, why are you
called "the Stardust Witch"?

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:04.290
Because it's cool, of course!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.700
Well? What do you think about "the Ashen Witch"?

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.740
It's fine.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:13.540
It's decided then.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.240
Ashen Witch, Elaina.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.040
Please do your best from now on.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.740
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:31.490
Well then, I'm off.

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:33.620
Where?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.200
Miss Fran told me then

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:41.540
that she was actually a distinguished
witch from another country.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.040
Then, why did you come here?

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:46.080
There was someone I wanted to meet.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:47.490
Someone you wanted to meet?

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:50.200
Did you meet them?

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:55.200
I wish I could stay longer,

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:58.580
but there are many people
waiting for me back home.

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.330
Goodbye, Elaina.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.410
Let's meet again someday.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.910
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:26.290
Goodbye, Miss Fran!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:37.870
Father, Mother, I've become a witch.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:40.200
So please allow me to go on a journey.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:43.580
You don't have to rush things, do you?

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:44.950
You're serious, aren't you?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.080
Of course.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.830
Then, go.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.240
I will.

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:57.200
However, there are three promises you must keep.

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:02.370
First, if you are in trouble, run away.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:07.290
Second, don't think of
yourself as anyone special.

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.870
Don't forget that you're
the same as everyone else.

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:18.240
And third, make sure you come back one day
and show us that you're doing well.

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:19.790
Can you keep these promises?

00:22:20.830 --> 00:22:22.490
Yes!

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.540
A-Are you really leaving...?

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:28.740
It's something she decided for herself.

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.290
Let's see her off properly, okay?

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:39.200
Dear, you seem like you'll die
of shock when Elaina gets married...

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:45.370
It looks good on you.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.080
Isn't it a little plain?

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:51.370
That's exactly right for a traveler.

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.910
Take this, too, just in case.

00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:56.700
It's the same as what I'm wearing, right?

00:22:56.700 --> 00:22:59.370
It's just in case the wind blows it away.

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:00.740
A spare?

00:23:00.740 --> 00:23:01.990
A spare.

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:05.290
Then, I'll bring it with me.

00:23:05.290 --> 00:23:07.040
Also--

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:11.870
A diary?

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.910
Write a diary of your travels like Nike.

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:19.540
Let me hear your story
when you come back someday.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.080
Okay, I'll bring it with me, too.

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:27.490
Please look forward to hearing the
story of the journey of the Ashen Witch.

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:29.290
I will.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.490
Have a good trip, Elaina.

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:37.290
I will!

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:40.040
And so, I set off on my journey.

00:23:40.040 --> 00:23:42.660
As the wind blows, as my fancy led me,

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:46.040
I traveled here and there
and experienced many things,

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:48.200
and three years passed.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:51.740
Now, here's a question:

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.410
Who is the witch so
beautiful she'd make you sigh

00:23:54.410 --> 00:24:00.410
flying through the stark mountain range?

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:01.910
That's right--

00:24:01.910 --> 00:24:05.160
It's me, age 18.
